    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you a prey or predator, a world where magic moves you through the islands of void. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the Finish ORB, then when magic is disabled;  find the exit lamp to move you to the next island. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 3d platformer of a small inhabitant of the void island, who is able to transcend to other floating void islands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge enemies and complete the levels as a passifist animal, but other void creatures are not the same and may attack or defend </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many Void slands to explore, C++ Beach Engine 1.5 (Now 2.0). Developed by hojiin studios.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LAN SETTINGS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It should work out the box, but if you're using paid antivirus, which controls your firewall you may have to create a rule for the .exe in order to play COOP (and you're hosting).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821250/extras/be1b8c1a3abbe3b7ab1838948ea38d0a.avif?t=1754583323\" width=800 height=508 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you a prey or predator, a world where magic moves you through the islands of void. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the Finish ORB, then when magic is disabled;  find the exit lamp to move you to the next island. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 3d platformer of a small inhabitant of the void island, who is able to transcend to other floating void islands. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge enemies and complete the levels as a passifist animal, but other void creatures are not the same and may attack or defend </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many Void slands to explore, C++ Beach Engine 1.5 (Now 2.0). Developed by hojiin studios.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LAN SETTINGS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It should work out the box, but if you're using paid antivirus, which controls your firewall you may have to create a rule for the .exe in order to play COOP (and you're hosting).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821250/extras/be1b8c1a3abbe3b7ab1838948ea38d0a.avif?t=1754583323\" width=800 height=508 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
